section
open NumberField GlobalTheory.UnitaryBC IsDedekindDomain Matrix Polynomial GlobalTheory.CuspRep Formalism.UG GlobalTheory.BCT GlobalTheory.KapLat GlobalTheory.KapOrb
open scoped Classical

